* LM4040-2.5V Precision Micropower Shunt Voltage Reference
* Thu tu chan theo CosmicWatch v3X (U7): 1=C (Cathode), 2=A (Anode), 3=NA
.subckt LM4040_2P5 C A NA
.param VNOM=2.500 ZR=0.3 TC_PPM=100

* Dien ap chuan bien thien theo nhiet do (max 100ppm/C theo datasheet)
B_VREF VZ A V=VNOM * (1 + (TC_PPM*1e-6)*(temp - 25))

* Dan shunt khi V(C,A) > V(VZ,A) qua tro dong ZR=0.3 ohm
D_SHUNT C VZ D_IDEAL
D_REV A C D_SILICON
.model D_IDEAL D(Ron={ZR} Roff=10Meg Vfwd=0)
.model D_SILICON D(Is=1e-12 Rs=0.5 N=1)
R_LEAK C A 10Meg
R_NA NA A 1G
.ends LM4040_2P5